Name Quest Note - Omega Pesticides

Interactability_Text_Line_0 COMMON BUG
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ISSUES AND SOLUTIONS
Interactability_Text_Line_2 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_3 1) In case of an Aphid problem, use the purple chemicals.
Interactability_Text_Line_4 2) In case of a Cucumber Beetle problem, use the blue chemicals.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 3) In case of a Spotted Asparagus Beetle problem, use the cyan chemicals.
